        "description": {
          "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Trigger:</em> A creature misses the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} with a melee attack roll using a weapon. <em>Response—Strength Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=REXRXKjH0DCr9s3M]], the triggering creature. <em>Failure:</em> The attack’s weapon sticks to the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}’s shield. If the target doesn’t let go of the weapon, the target has the &amp;Reference[Grappled apply=false] condition while the weapon is stuck (escape DC 11). While stuck, the weapon can’t be used. The target can take an action to make a DC 11 Strength (Athletics) check, freeing the weapon on a success.</p>",
